<div class="grid grid-main repayment-entry">
<section class="card">
<div class="card-head"><h2>记录还款</h2><a class="btn btn-sm" href="/finance">贷款与信用卡</a></div>
<% if(!targets.length){ %><div class="empty">先登记贷款或设置信用卡账期，再记录实际还款。<p class="mt16"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/finance">设置还款对象</a></p></div><% }else{ %>
<form method="get" action="/transactions/new" id="repayment-target-form"><input type="hidden" name="type" value="repayment"><div class="field"><label for="repayment-target">还款对象</label><select id="repayment-target" name="target" required><% targets.forEach(target=>{const value=target.target_kind+':'+target.target_id; %><option value="<%= value %>" <%= selected&&selected.target_kind+':'+selected.target_id===value?'selected':'' %>><%= target.target_kind==='card'?'信用卡':'贷款' %> · <%= target.name %></option><% }); %></select></div><noscript><button class="btn">查看所选对象</button></noscript></form>
<% targets.forEach(target=>{const key=target.target_kind+':'+target.target_id;const chosen=selected&&selected.target_kind+':'+selected.target_id===key; %><div data-repayment-target="<%= key %>" class="<%= chosen?'':'hidden' %>"><%- include('partials/finance-payment-form',{kind:target.target_kind,targetId:target.target_id,suggestedAmount:target.suggested_amount_cents,loan:target.target_kind==='loan'?entryLoans[target.target_id]:null}) %></div><% }); %>
<% } %>
</section>
<aside><section class="card"><h2>自动对应账单与期次</h2><p class="help">信用卡还款自动抵扣最早到期的已出账账单，多还的金额作为预还款，后续出账自动抵扣。</p><p class="help">贷款默认带出最近未还期的金额与本金、利息、费用。实付与计划不同时再调整分项。</p><p class="help">这里只登记实际发生的还款，不会向银行发起扣款。亲友之间的还钱使用“偿还借款”。</p></section></aside>
</div>
